{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"cannot_tell\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"Meta regression revealed high-frequency stimulation in both targets was a significant moderator for gait improvement (95% CI −0.96 to −0.05, I2=39.2%).\",\n    \"In contrast, HSTN+HSNr was associated with a statistically significant reduction in the pooled effect size, (p=0.0287), suggesting a potential moderating effect of high-frequency stimulation (HFS).\",\n    \"no difference of improvement was observed during high frequency versus low frequency in gait speed and step length.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"Eight crossover RCTs (n=97) were included.\",\n    \"The pooled analysis for the FoG outcome, which was reported by seven studies, is presented in figure 3.\",\n    \"One study used the HFPS (Heel–Flat–Push–Swing) parameter, while the rest used the FOG-Q (Freezing of Gait Questionnaire) parameter. In contrast, the other two studies used the Freezing of Gait Assessment Course (FOG-AC).\",\n    \"A systematic search was conducted across PubMed, ScienceDirect and Scopus databases up to October 2025.\",\n    \"All included studies were crossover RCTs and double-blinded.\",\n    \"Meta-regression analyses were conducted to explore potential moderators influencing the pooled effect on FoG outcome.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告_supported判为cannot_tell：附件只有论文全文，没有报告第3.4节及其表格，因此无法核实报告是否将2018、2025和2026年Meta分析并列，也无法判断其是否遗漏了某项研究结果。论文确实报告了高频刺激相关获益，但限定条件很重要：统计学显著的调节效应具体出现在HSTN+HSNr组合，而不是单独高频STN刺激；HSTN+低频SNr、HSTN+中频SNr及低频STN+高频SNr均未显示显著效应。此外，论文还指出高频与低频刺激在步速和步长改善方面没有观察到差异。judge_supported判为partly：指控者关于结局测量存在差异以及高频刺激存在特定获益的描述有部分依据，但其关键研究规模和检索日期不能与附件全文对应。附件明确报告的是8项交叉RCT、97名患者，7项研究报告FoG结局，检索时间截至2025年10月；并未报告31项研究、905名患者、21项提供FOG-Q数据或2025年9月28日这一具体截止日期。论文也没有提供关于不同Meta分析之间药物状态及刺激状态差异的系统比较。因此，不能将指控者所述31项研究等具体信息视为这篇论文全文已经证实的事实。总体而言，论文支持高频双靶点刺激存在特定的步态获益，但不支持将其直接扩大为高频STN单靶点具有更一致获益的结论。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "01bde613-7d95-43ed-a68b-b3afed9d12d5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261114T070544970124Z", "elapsed_seconds": 171.719, "completed_utc": "2026-11-14T07:08:36.708035+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e897ce224d0c09a42a835940c682fbda52c8f29dab2352fbf0150e886267acc4", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261114T070544970124Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "234b79456a096e07941060c4c60086c92c1fdfc097d164dd02452b0fbc61a233"}}}
